        <briefdescription>
<para>Get the string view of the debug name. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>String view from debugName/debugNameLen.</para>
</simplesect>
The user guarantees the debugName pointer to be alive only for the duration of the <ref refid="namespaced3d" kindref="compound">d3d</ref>:: call where the <ref refid="structShaderSource" kindref="compound">ShaderSource</ref> is passed The driver guarantees to copy the string if it needs it, and not retain the pointer The name is not stored as string_view initially to allow to put more data in the padding in the future </para>
        </detaileddescription>
