    <briefdescription>
<para>Extends <ref refid="structShaderSource" kindref="compound">ShaderSource</ref> with an optional debug name pointer+len, must be null terminated Unlike the base structure, the user only guarantees debugName to be valid during shader creation call, so drivers may store only the spliced out base <ref refid="structShaderSource" kindref="compound">ShaderSource</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
